    "PIT mode 4 (control word 0x38) rejected by the model; reachable only if the LAPIC timer fails",
    "UART autoconfig type on a model without FIFO/loopback; hctosys without rtc0; perf NMI watchdog without PMU",
    "link between source/config and the staged vmlinuz binary (S4-35 verifies hashes only)"
  ]
}
